{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-04-13 08:00:00', 'title': "MILLENNIUM SPACE SYSTEMS' TETRA-1 IS MISSION READY", 'text': "EL SEGUNDO, CALIF. , APRIL 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SINCE LAUNCHING TETRA-1 NOVEMBER 1, 2022, MILLENNIUM SPACE SYSTEMS, A BOEING (NYSE: BA) COMPANY PARTNERED WITH THE U.S. SPACE FORCE'S SPACE SYSTEMS COMMAND SUCCESSFULLY DEPLOYED THE VEHICLE FROM ITS HOST, INITIALIZED ALL COMPONENTS AND SUBSYSTEMS AND PERFORMED SYSTEMS CHECK OUT."}